# Project conventions (index)

Quick checklist; full wording is in the files under `.cursor/rules/`.

- **Build / dev server / typecheck**: Never run unless the user asks — `00-global-safety.mdc`.
- **Tests**: Do not add, modify, or run tests unless the user asks — `05-workflow-execution.mdc`. Vitest + Nuxt project layout and config files — `testing-vitest-nuxt.mdc`.
- **Prisma / migrations**: Shared client and migration policy — `backend-best-practices.mdc` (sections **Data Access** and **Prisma schema and migrations**). **Account membership** (`UserAccount` capabilities, list filtering) — **Data Access** in `backend-best-practices.mdc`; microservice env — `backend-security-and-ops.mdc`.
- **Encrypted field queries**: Never `in`/`contains` on `@encrypted` columns — `encrypted-prisma-queries.mdc`; details — `app/lib/normalizePrismaDmmf.ts`, `app/server/clients/prismaClient.ts`, `@encrypted` in `app/prisma/schema.prisma`.
- **Plaid**: Sync + balance write path — `plaid-sync.mdc`; encyclopedia — `app/server/services/PlaidSyncService.ts`, `app/server/cron/plaid*.ts`.
- **Register balances** (`balance` vs `latestBalance`): `register-balances.mdc`; model notes — `app/prisma/schema.prisma`.
- **Forecast money rounding**: `forecast-money-rounding.mdc`; engine notes — `app/server/services/forecast/`.
- **Code style / TS / Zod**: `10-code-style-and-ts.mdc`.

## How-it-works docs (`knowledge/`)

The generated OKF bundle in `knowledge/` is the how-it-works encyclopedia (see `okf-memory.mdc`; do not hand-edit it — corrections go in a PR comment or the source). Search with `okf search "<query>" knowledge --limit 3 --json` or start from `knowledge/index.md`. Areas the bundle does not cover yet — read the source: queues/cron (`app/server/queues/`, `app/server/cron/`), Plaid (`PlaidSyncService.ts`), forecast (`app/server/services/forecast/`), reconciliation (`reconciliationService.ts`, `app/server/api/reconciliation/`), microservice (`microservice/`), deploy/CI (`.github/workflows/`, `.deploy/`).
